    "pr_body": "cherry-pick #16324 to release-4.0\n\n---\n\n<!-- Thank you for contributing to TiDB!\r\n\r\nPR Title Format:\r\n1. pkg [, pkg2, pkg3]: what's changed\r\n2. *: what's changed\r\n\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### What problem does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIssue Number: close #15639 <!-- REMOVE this line if no issue to close -->\r\n\r\nProblem Summary:\r\nIf `insert into t1(c2) values (null);` runs firstly, the error will be `[ddl:1265]Data truncated for column 'c2' at row 1` instead of `[ddl:8214]Cancelled DDL job`.\r\n\r\n### What is changed and how it works?\r\nPut ``insert into t1(c2) values (null);`` after loop where the DDL is canceled.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Related changes\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Check List <!--REMOVE the items that are not applicable-->\r\n\r\nTests <!-- At least one of them must be included. -->\r\n\r\n- No code\r\n\r\nSide effects\r\n\r\n\r\n### Release note <!-- bugfixes or new feature need a release note -->\r\n",
